{"5150620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scan N Go: Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 5150620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or up to 8 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own convenience store with the added option to run the store with your friends in online coop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/b0369dc9d7d9bcfe5695c004a7cb6c79.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/b0369dc9d7d9bcfe5695c004a7cb6c79.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/b0369dc9d7d9bcfe5695c004a7cb6c79.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock shelves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to keep shelves stocked as customers may be looking for something specific</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/be21dc1fb933f1d0ee505c1d8ad5ed45.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/be21dc1fb933f1d0ee505c1d8ad5ed45.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/be21dc1fb933f1d0ee505c1d8ad5ed45.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase products and merchandise for your store with the business menu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the business menu you can purchase upgrades, make purchase orders and more to enhance your store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/1d622bc742471d5c54982a9e6edf3b75.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/1d622bc742471d5c54982a9e6edf3b75.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/1d622bc742471d5c54982a9e6edf3b75.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the business menu to expand your store to open up more shop space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding your store will allow for more shelf space and more products for shoppers to buy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/d037e3db3bb48b77218b4856fc7ca582.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/d037e3db3bb48b77218b4856fc7ca582.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/d037e3db3bb48b77218b4856fc7ca582.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build within your the store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build product shelves, storage shelves, checkout stations and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/4ff8dea6272fc8446bdf333c4dda7357.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/4ff8dea6272fc8446bdf333c4dda7357.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/4ff8dea6272fc8446bdf333c4dda7357.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire employees to help speed up the checkout process</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hiring an employee you can designate them a role. Employees can either run checkout stations or restock merchandise left on storage shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/7ec764bb06d270b44381ac7cbd5dc2dc.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/7ec764bb06d270b44381ac7cbd5dc2dc.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/7ec764bb06d270b44381ac7cbd5dc2dc.mp4?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pay Bills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees don't work for free! Be sure to pay these cute little guys for their hard work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/c839922766137eea4d634f5adf349c54.poster.avif?t=1788331323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/c839922766137eea4d634f5adf349c54.webm?t=1788331323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5150620/extras/c839